      <bpmn2:documentation>Perform all necessary work to review and assess the request and understand the impact, or rework proposal. Prepare recommendations.</bpmn2:documentation>
      <bpmn2:incoming>SequenceFlow_1o7zucb</bpmn2:incoming>
      <bpmn2:incoming>SequenceFlow_0tsxvfo</bpmn2:incoming>
